sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pegawai as "Pegawai"
    participant View as "Web View (employee.shift-swaps.index / accept-open)"
    participant Controller as "Employee ShiftSwapController"
    participant Model as "ShiftSwapRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pegawai->>View: Klik Terima / Setuju pada request tukar shift
    View->>Controller: POST /employee/shift-swaps/{id}/accept atau /accept-open
    Controller->>Controller: Validasi kepemilikan target shift
    Controller->>Model: acceptRequest(id, worker_id) / acceptOpenRequest(id, worker_id, target_shift_id)
    Model->>DB: SELECT shift_swap_requests + update status
    DB-->>Model: Data request

    alt Data valid (request dapat diterima)
        Controller->>View: Redirect index + success
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi permintaan diterima
    else Data tidak valid (bukan target / request tidak tersedia / validasi gagal)
        Controller->>View: Back + error
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi gagal menerima permintaan
    end
